WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,330
This cow gave herself a carving.

2
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:07,330
My boss is not here

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:08,330
I have to ask you for permission first.

4
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:13,060
Why, your base is not here?

5
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,060
Of course not

6
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,060
That's just my eldest son's home

7
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,060
Our base is at the back

8
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:32,900
His home has tens of thousands of acres

9
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:41,940
Other bases have not even resumed farming.

10
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,060
This is fully automated
